(text "Automated Micropipetting System - Imperial College London, DAPP Group F (2025)" (at 25.4 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5a755df8-97a9-5af5-a0fd-30e556f7acb9))
(text "Redrawn from the report's KiCad figure (Appendix F). Connectivity uses net labels." (at 25.4 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 87766c33-369e-5097-85b1-909aa45d3549))
(text "Pin assignments follow the firmware. The report figure differs: it shows one axis only, DIR/STEP on D6/D7 (swapped)," (at 25.4 236.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 57329efa-13a3-5505-93bc-e622cc1e8a03))
(text "the buzzer on D52 and the Nextion on TX0/RX0. The firmware uses buzzer D2 and Serial1 (TX1 = D18, RX1 = D19)." (at 25.4 240.03 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6b4b65bb-8665-5994-ba02-cc8a7d73f757))
(text "R1/R2 values were not given in the report. VMOT_GND and LAC_V- are separate returns as drawn; tie to GND if supplies share a ground." (at 25.4 243.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e98bdfdd-204c-5956-8887-18a3c8db8dec))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
